{"overview":"وقتی یک سندیکای خطرناک گسترش می‌یابد و صلح خانواده‌اش را تهدید می‌کند، نگهبان بازنشسته تایگر موثوول پاندیان به‌عنوان راننده زیرپوش می‌شود. او از سایه‌ها عمل می‌کند و برای محافظت از خانه‌اش با دشمنان بی‌رحم جدیدی روبه‌رو می‌شود.","tagline":"","overview_en":"When a dangerous syndicate expands its reach to threaten his family's peace, retired jailer Tiger Muthuvel Pandian goes undercover as a driver. Operating from the shadows, he takes on ruthless new enemies to protect his home.","tagline_en":"","runtime":175,"status":"Post Production","seasons":[],"episodes":null,"crew":["Nelson Dilipkumar"],"crew_en":[],"countries":["IN"],"cast":[{"name":"راجینیکانت","role":"Muthuvel 'Tiger' Pandian","photo":"/cQBcrXqcQPfXOQfNfgO3slJM2xi.jpg","en":"Rajinikanth"},{"name":"S. J. Suryah","role":"Bodhi Kalpak","photo":"/7Q8510XwxPU1193cteaFQsiq2rv.jpg"},{"name":"Suraj Venjaramoodu","role":"Dileep","photo":"/2FUs0wmR3eHBd8g4GVbCmhkUzeI.jpg"},{"name":"Mithun Chakraborty","role":"Champaklal Chaubey","photo":"/4z8c5YAe0TCkEZNHXWlKxNTD8sV.jpg"},{"name":"Ramya Krishnan","role":"Vijayalakshmi 'Viji' Pandian","photo":"/7C1bj7z3XhqxjDIGoCs6MFJdSVa.jpg"},{"name":"Vidya Balan","role":"Kantha Kalpak","photo":"/m4bnX5VQs2DfvQsLmfbKbBxUkC9.jpg"},{"name":"யோகி பாபு","role":"Vimal","photo":"/4UMOPd8NqGfKp19VQHsnIzlSRUl.jpg","en":"Yogi Babu"},{"name":"Mirnaa","role":"Shwetha Arjun","photo":"/l4bmtLBuBPEE2Pg3qh5NTdmKFYP.jpg"},{"name":"Rithvik","role":"Rithvik 'Rithu' Pandian","photo":"/9j9GPeTCDcqBW5TMDoQwz30usT7.jpg"},{"name":"Jatin Sarna","role":"","photo":"/bnKqppKcRxSiEPiq2Fmbriibf5N.jpg"},{"name":"Bagavathi Perumal","role":"","photo":"/ixK5bTpLOIXc8oJVE1IVMzcJrB2.jpg"},{"name":"Kottayam Nazeer","role":"","photo":"/vN0cHxgDIE5DKUeL2F0nmIhTIoZ.jpg"}],"trailer":"","watch":{},"recs":[],"tmdb":"https://www.themoviedb.org/movie/1234139"}